<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Immune Response started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Immune Response started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal Investment Research said analysts David Saks and Adam Greene initiated coverage of Immune Response Corp with an outperform rating and a two-year price target of $16.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/2 to 7-9/16.</p>
</text>
